Dear Equality and Human Rights Commission,

I write to notify you that Judicial Review proceedings have been issued and=
 served in Zahmoul v SSJ & HMCTS (AC-2025-LON-004293).

The claim concerns failures to comply with the Equality Act 2010 and the Pu=
blic Sector Equality Duty, in conjunction with alleged misadministration of =
court-controlled electronic material under HMCTS=E2=80=99s responsibility.

Filed documents are available in a public archive:
https://github.com/nadiazahmoul/JR-Zahmoul-v-SSJ-HMCTS-Archive

Yours faithfully,
Nadia Zahmoul

=20

